flowchart TB
  R[Request + Bearer JWT] --> F[JWT filter: verify signature, expiry, revocation]
  F -->|tid claim = tenant| TC[TenantContext thread-local]
  TC --> AZ[Authorization: role + tenant membership]
  AZ --> S[Service layer]
  S --> HF[Hibernate tenant filter + explicit tenant_id predicates]
  HF --> DB[(PostgreSQL shared schema, tenant_id on every row)]
  DB -.->|docker profile| RLS[Row-level security policy app.tenant_id]
  S --> CK[Cache keys t:tenantId:...]
  S --> EV[Outbox events carry tenantId]
  X[Client-supplied tenant id] -.->|ignored| TC
